{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 為慶祝精靈寶可夢（Pokémon）誕生 30 週年，推出了一系列專為 iPhone 設計的原創桌布。這套桌布共有四款，其中包含一款特別針對 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 設計的版本。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 11 16 21.00.41\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"963\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-16-21.00.41-1024x963.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>本次推出的桌布以「啃果蟲」（Applin）為核心主題，這種外觀酷似蘋果的精靈寶可夢在設計中佔據重要地位。除了兩款不同樣式的啃果蟲桌布外，還有一款名為「皮卡丘與朋友們」的桌布。值得注意的是，其中一款啃果蟲變體桌布提供了適合 iPhone Duo 尺寸的特殊版本供用戶下載。</p>\n<h2>日本 Apple Store 配合周年活動</h2>\n<p>除了線上桌布，位於日本的 Apple Store 也在銷售印有啃果蟲圖案的特別禮品卡，並在其他推廣元素上配合此次慶祝活動。該促銷活動將持續至 11 月 30 日。</p>\n<p>今年早些時候，當時仍擔任執行長的 Tim Cook 與現任執行長 John Ternus 曾在 Apple Park 接待了皮卡丘及 The Pokémon Company 的首席執行官。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"wallpaper iphone\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wallpaper-iphone-471x1024.webp\" width=\"471\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"wallpaper iphone 2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wallpaper-iphone-2-471x1024.webp\" width=\"471\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"wallpaper iphone 1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wallpaper-iphone-1-471x1024.webp\" width=\"471\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://offers.applegiftcard.apple/pokemon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">下載位置</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T21:23:30.099816+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":433,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T20:19:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T19:12:42.557259+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T21:17:00.137940+00:00","content_hash":"10832b84b21676a128cd1e2320ba1466f26ac531215870eef0d5721b19285909","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T21:23:30.099816+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}